  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased climate resilience planning for municipal water resources in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall objective is to support the Government of Lebanon in strengthening the NAP process by developing a CCA strategy and roadmap and increasing the resilience of water resource planning in urban areas in Lebanon with a focus on Nahr el Kaleb Watershed and Tyre city.The United Nations Development Programme (UNDP), as the Delivery Partner (DP), will implement the project in close coordination</narrative>
  </description>
